abstract: >-
  A repository of Scala/Stainless-verified proofs, from-scratch recursive
  constructions, and accompanying written articles covering integer
  division and modulo, recursively defined lists, cycles, discrete
  integrals over cycles, Euclid's theorem on the infinitude of primes,
  sieve-sequence stages and their transitions, structural properties of
  2-gaps, relaxed almost-prime production, and survival frontiers of
  balanced 2-gap companion processes. The source code (src/, python/,
  spark/) is licensed under MIT; the written articles (articles/) are
  licensed separately under CC BY 4.0 — see articles/LICENSE.
